          "notes_base": "Rating 4.9 stars on Gaode Maps. Romantic boutique inn in Shuhe Old Town (束河古镇), one of Lijiang's most charming and less-crowded old towns. Perfect 文艺温馨 atmosphere for couples. Located at the end of Qingquan Road near the 'Flowers Touching Water' scenic spot. Also alias: 丽江束河情人节假日客栈. Convenient for Day 4's Shuhe coffee wandering plan. Est. 400-500 CNY/night.",
          "notes_local": "高德地图评分4.9星。位于束河古镇清泉路尽头飞花触水旁，是丽江最具文艺气息的精品情侣客栈之一。古朴纳西风格庭院，适合情侣入住。第四天束河喝咖啡随缘散步极为便利。预估400-500元/晚。",
